Looking at this problem, I need to prove that for positive reals $a_1, \ldots, a_n$ summing to 1:

$$\sum_{k=1}^{n} \frac{a_k}{1-a_k}\left(a_1+\cdots+a_{k-1}\right)^{2}<\frac{1}{3}$$

